    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a boy on a journey to eliminate demons in the world. To defeat all the demons from the world, skills alone are not enough, upgrade your strength and skills to fight them and repel the evil demons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The game is set in medieval times,\u00a0The main character possesses many different skills and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene: The world is full of demons and more than 10 types of demons from Vietnam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perspective: The game has a top-down perspective and possesses beautiful combat mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Top-down auto-battle role-playing game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play:\u00a0To fight the demons easier, upgrade the player's potential and skills. The game has many skills for players to choose from to fight them.</p>",
